      "comment": "DIVORCE SOURCE (2) tends to take a while to wind up, missing the placings two back but running on to last time finishing third (20.30) in a Mix 1/2/3 at this track. Form at the trip sound including 16 wins. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Rates highly and will give a great sight. ANNIHILATING (7) has missed the frame at his last two but did run well three back when third (20.22) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. ROCKY PEPPER (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (20.51) in a Mix 1/2/3 at this track. The form out of his last race has been franked. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. GREAT MARLOW (4) can sneak into the finish.",
